    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9555863644,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-9dafea737d1d",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1288.8,
      "y": 1160.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 280.0,
      "seed": 533511,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Apply Complete Is Not Healthy\nTerraform reports success when the API accepts\nthe objects. Whether the pods then run depends\non images, resources and configuration.\n`helm_release` waits for its objects by\ndefault, for up to 300 seconds per operation\n([release doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/te\nrraform-provider-helm/blob/v3.3.0/docs/resourc\nes/release.md#L59-L64)). Setting `wait =\nfalse` makes applies faster, but then a broken\nrelease also reports success. The\n`kubectl_manifest` resource waits only for a\nDeployment to roll out ([kubectl doc](https://\ngithub.com/gavinbunney/terraform-provider-kube\nctl/blob/v1.19.0/docs/resources/kubectl_manife\nst.md#L37)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-9dafea737d1d",
      "originalText": "Apply Complete Is Not Healthy\nTerraform reports success when the API accepts the objects. Whether the pods then run depends on images, resources and configuration. `helm_release` waits for its objects by default, for up to 300 seconds per operation ([release doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-helm/blob/v3.3.0/docs/resources/release.md#L59-L64)). Setting `wait = false` makes applies faster, but then a broken release also reports success. The `kubectl_manifest` resource waits only for a Deployment to roll out ([kubectl doc](https://github.com/gavinbunney/terraform-provider-kubectl/blob/v1.19.0/docs/resources/kubectl_manifest.md#L37)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "apply-complete-is-not-healthy"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
