    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5106829189,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-56adf4e03191",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 2200.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 402.5,
      "seed": 42151,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Plan Signals\n| Line in the plan | Meaning |\n| --- | --- |\n| Errors such as `Failed to construct REST\nclient` on every Kubernetes resource | The\nprovider settings depend on a cluster that the\nplan will create or replace. |\n| `no matches for kind \"PrometheusRule\"` | A\n`kubernetes_manifest` needs a CRD that is not\ninstalled yet. |\n| `metadata` of a `helm_release` as `(known\nafter apply)` | Normal for any change to the\nchart or its values ([release code](https://gi\nthub.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-helm/blo\nb/v2.13.0/helm/resource_release.go#L826-L843))\n. |\n| `-/+` on a Service of type LoadBalancer in\nevery apply | A controller set a field that\ncannot change; the load balancer gets a new\naddress each time. |\n| `(sensitive value)` in place of all Helm\nvalues | One sensitive input made the whole\nvalues text sensitive. |",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-56adf4e03191",
      "originalText": "Plan Signals\n| Line in the plan | Meaning |\n| --- | --- |\n| Errors such as `Failed to construct REST client` on every Kubernetes resource | The provider settings depend on a cluster that the plan will create or replace. |\n| `no matches for kind \"PrometheusRule\"` | A `kubernetes_manifest` needs a CRD that is not installed yet. |\n| `metadata` of a `helm_release` as `(known after apply)` | Normal for any change to the chart or its values ([release code](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-helm/blob/v2.13.0/helm/resource_release.go#L826-L843)). |\n| `-/+` on a Service of type LoadBalancer in every apply | A controller set a field that cannot change; the load balancer gets a new address each time. |\n| `(sensitive value)` in place of all Helm values | One sensitive input made the whole values text sensitive. |",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "k8s-plan-signals"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
