      "height": 262.5,
      "seed": 320563,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Providers from the Same Apply\nWhen the provider settings read the cluster's\naddress from resources in the same\nconfiguration, a plan for a new or replaced\ncluster has no address yet. Every Kubernetes\nresource then fails, for example with \"Failed\nto construct REST client\" ([issue 1775](https:\n//github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-kube\nrnetes/issues/1775)), or calls `localhost`.\nSeparate states for the cluster and for what\nruns inside it fix this. A documented\nbootstrap with `-target` works too, but\nTerraform reserves `-target` for exceptional\ncases ([plan command](https://developer.hashic\norp.com/terraform/cli/commands/plan)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-d1da763b6653",
      "originalText": "Providers from the Same Apply\nWhen the provider settings read the cluster's address from resources in the same configuration, a plan for a new or replaced cluster has no address yet. Every Kubernetes resource then fails, for example with \"Failed to construct REST client\" ([issue 1775](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-kubernetes/issues/1775)), or calls `localhost`. Separate states for the cluster and for what runs inside it fix this. A documented bootstrap with `-target` works too, but Terraform reserves `-target` for exceptional cases ([plan command](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/cli/commands/plan)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "providers-from-same-apply"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3615841066,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-e00cd90be692",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1888.0,
