      "height": 332.5,
      "seed": 829216,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CRDs Needed at Plan Time\n`kubernetes_manifest` reads the API schema of\nits kind during the plan, so the cluster must\nbe reachable and the CRD must exist ([manifest\ndoc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-pr\novider-kubernetes/blob/v3.5.0/docs/resources/m\nanifest.md#L82)). A custom resource planned in\nthe same run as the chart that installs its\nCRD fails with `no matches for kind`. There\nare three ways out:\n\n- Install the CRDs in an earlier apply.\n- Use `kubectl_manifest`, which looks up the\nkind only at apply time ([kubectl code](https:\n//github.com/gavinbunney/terraform-provider-ku\nbectl/blob/v1.19.0/kubernetes/resource_kubectl\n_manifest.go#L218-L245)).\n- Put the custom resources into a small chart\nof their own.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-e00cd90be692",
      "originalText": "CRDs Needed at Plan Time\n`kubernetes_manifest` reads the API schema of its kind during the plan, so the cluster must be reachable and the CRD must exist ([manifest doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-kubernetes/blob/v3.5.0/docs/resources/manifest.md#L82)). A custom resource planned in the same run as the chart that installs its CRD fails with `no matches for kind`. There are three ways out:\n\n- Install the CRDs in an earlier apply.\n- Use `kubectl_manifest`, which looks up the kind only at apply time ([kubectl code](https://github.com/gavinbunney/terraform-provider-kubectl/blob/v1.19.0/kubernetes/resource_kubectl_manifest.go#L218-L245)).\n- Put the custom resources into a small chart of their own.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "crds-needed-at-plan-time"
      }
    },
