    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9396803432,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-c7bdd57d18b1",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1849.6,
      "y": 3240.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 280.0,
      "seed": 436855,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Failed and Stuck Releases\nWhen an install fails, the release can stay in\nHelm's record. The next apply then fails with\n\"cannot re-use a name that is still in use\"\n([issue 1886](https://github.com/hashicorp/ter\nraform-provider-helm/issues/1886)). An apply\nthat is killed mid-operation can leave the\nrelease in a `pending-*` state, and every\nlater run fails with \"another operation\n(install/upgrade/rollback) is in progress\".\nRecovery needs `helm rollback` or `helm\nuninstall` by hand. `atomic = true` removes a\nfailed install automatically; it defaults to\n`false` ([release doc](https://github.com/hash\nicorp/terraform-provider-helm/blob/v3.3.0/docs\n/resources/release.md#L25)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-c7bdd57d18b1",
      "originalText": "Failed and Stuck Releases\nWhen an install fails, the release can stay in Helm's record. The next apply then fails with \"cannot re-use a name that is still in use\" ([issue 1886](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-helm/issues/1886)). An apply that is killed mid-operation can leave the release in a `pending-*` state, and every later run fails with \"another operation (install/upgrade/rollback) is in progress\". Recovery needs `helm rollback` or `helm uninstall` by hand. `atomic = true` removes a failed install automatically; it defaults to `false` ([release doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-helm/blob/v3.3.0/docs/resources/release.md#L25)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "failed-and-stuck-releases"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5661750309,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-e854fa88b6cc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1837.6,
      "y": 3500.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "#FEF3C7",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 220.0,
      "seed": 835894,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3,
        "value": 8
      },
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
