      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Invisible Drift\nSome changes never show in a plan: a chart\nthat someone upgraded by hand, an object that\nsomeone edited, or an image tag `latest` that\nmoved. Terraform compares only its inputs (see\nThree Records of Truth). Pin chart versions\nand image tags, and do not change\nTerraform-managed releases by hand.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-5e3896ec5d44",
      "originalText": "Invisible Drift\nSome changes never show in a plan: a chart that someone upgraded by hand, an object that someone edited, or an image tag `latest` that moved. Terraform compares only its inputs (see Three Records of Truth). Pin chart versions and image tags, and do not change Terraform-managed releases by hand.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "invisible-drift"
      }
    },
