      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Secrets in State\nThe data of a `kubernetes_secret` sits in the\nstate in plain text ([secret doc](https://gith\nub.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-kubernetes\n/blob/v3.5.0/docs/resources/secret_v1.md#L14))\n. The write-only argument `data_wo` keeps it\nout, with Terraform 1.11 or later. An operator\nthat copies secrets from AWS Secrets Manager\ninto the cluster keeps them out of Terraform\nentirely.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-f3a0c899a127",
      "originalText": "Secrets in State\nThe data of a `kubernetes_secret` sits in the state in plain text ([secret doc](https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-kubernetes/blob/v3.5.0/docs/resources/secret_v1.md#L14)). The write-only argument `data_wo` keeps it out, with Terraform 1.11 or later. An operator that copies secrets from AWS Secrets Manager into the cluster keeps them out of Terraform entirely.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "k8s-secrets-in-state"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6545754207,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-6c28b148d57e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
