      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Access Through aws-auth\nThe `aws-auth` ConfigMap holds all\nIAM-to-Kubernetes mappings in one object,\nincluding the entries that let nodes join the\ncluster. A configuration that writes the whole\nobject must keep those entries, or nodes lose\naccess. EKS access entries replace the\nConfigMap. The access mode moves one way only:\nfrom `CONFIG_MAP` to `API_AND_CONFIG_MAP` to\n`API` ([EKS module upgrade notes](https://gith\nub.com/terraform-aws-modules/terraform-aws-eks\n/blob/v21.30.2/docs/UPGRADE-20.0.md#L221-L223)\n). Keep the node entries that EKS created\nuntil matching access entries exist\n([migrating to access entries](https://docs.aw\ns.amazon.com/eks/latest/userguide/migrating-ac\ncess-entries.html)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-6c28b148d57e",
      "originalText": "Access Through aws-auth\nThe `aws-auth` ConfigMap holds all IAM-to-Kubernetes mappings in one object, including the entries that let nodes join the cluster. A configuration that writes the whole object must keep those entries, or nodes lose access. EKS access entries replace the ConfigMap. The access mode moves one way only: from `CONFIG_MAP` to `API_AND_CONFIG_MAP` to `API` ([EKS module upgrade notes](https://github.com/terraform-aws-modules/terraform-aws-eks/blob/v21.30.2/docs/UPGRADE-20.0.md#L221-L223)). Keep the node entries that EKS created until matching access entries exist ([migrating to access entries](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/eks/latest/userguide/migrating-access-entries.html)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "access-through-aws-auth"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3979908360,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-240a3f2575f3",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
