    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7935785471,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-404ac26a0315",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 5942.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 367.5,
      "seed": 77737,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Choose the Custom Resource Tool\n| Tool | For | Against |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `kubernetes_manifest` | Maintained by\nHashiCorp, server-side apply, typed diff |\nNeeds the CRD at plan time |\n| `kubectl_manifest` | Plan does not need the\nCRD | Drift shows only as an opaque\nfingerprint; the original provider has stalled\n|\n| A small chart of raw objects | Helm handles\nthe order and the lifecycle | One more chart\nto maintain |\n\nThe original `gavinbunney/kubectl` provider is\n\"functionally stalled\", according to the fork\n`alekc/kubectl`, which supports a `moved`\nblock to migrate ([fork ADR](https://github.co\nm/alekc/terraform-provider-kubectl/blob/v3.0.2\n/docs/adr/0001-framework-migration-and-moved-b\nlocks.md#L14-L22)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-404ac26a0315",
      "originalText": "Choose the Custom Resource Tool\n| Tool | For | Against |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `kubernetes_manifest` | Maintained by HashiCorp, server-side apply, typed diff | Needs the CRD at plan time |\n| `kubectl_manifest` | Plan does not need the CRD | Drift shows only as an opaque fingerprint; the original provider has stalled |\n| A small chart of raw objects | Helm handles the order and the lifecycle | One more chart to maintain |\n\nThe original `gavinbunney/kubectl` provider is \"functionally stalled\", according to the fork `alekc/kubectl`, which supports a `moved` block to migrate ([fork ADR](https://github.com/alekc/terraform-provider-kubectl/blob/v3.0.2/docs/adr/0001-framework-migration-and-moved-blocks.md#L14-L22)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "choose-the-custom-resource-tool"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
