      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "About the Sources\nThe provider facts come from `hashicorp/kubernetes`\nat tag v3.5.0, `hashicorp/helm` at tags v3.3.0 and\nv2.13.0, `gavinbunney/kubectl` at tag v1.19.0 and\n`alekc/kubectl` at tag v3.0.2. The Kubernetes, Helm\nand EKS facts come from their official docs. All\nwere read on 2026-11-23.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 16.25,
      "containerId": "node-431c81fa8aba",
      "originalText": "About the Sources\nThe provider facts come from `hashicorp/kubernetes` at tag v3.5.0, `hashicorp/helm` at tags v3.3.0 and v2.13.0, `gavinbunney/kubectl` at tag v1.19.0 and `alekc/kubectl` at tag v3.0.2. The Kubernetes, Helm and EKS facts come from their official docs. All were read on 2026-11-23.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "k8s-about-the-sources"
      }
    },
